{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/1059957-2e-is-this-the-milestone","id":1059957,"title":"[2E] Is this the Milestone?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Promethean: The Created"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-07T22:59:41-08:00","id":1059957,"title":"[2E] Is this the Milestone?","content":"Topic for those unsure is particular action should be Milestone - and if yes, what level it would be? My first example problem:<br /> <br /> When character is changing Refinements based on actions and goals of character after Superlative Milestone - Will Refinement shift be <b>another</b> Superlative or Major Milestone?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-10T06:44:52-08:00","id":1060846,"title":"","content":"I can't quite figure out this bit:<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> based on actions and goals of character after Superlative Milestone </div> </div> </div>Do you mean the character achieves a Superlative Milestone and changes Refinement based on what they learned, or <i>another</i> character achieves the Milestone and the character you're talking about changes Refinement based on what they saw?<br /> <br /> In the first case, I would say no: the change in Refinement is bound up in what you learned and part of the same Milestone that provoked it (I would be receptive to arguments for upping the &quot;ranking&quot; of the Milestone, though).<br /> <br /> In the second case, I think it could be. Understanding others and learning from them is a big part of being human, so I could see changing your approach to the Pilgrimmage in response to another's realisation could be a Milestone. But it might be worth waiting until it becomes clear whether you were right or wrong to do so, and make <i>that</i> the Milestone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-10T23:17:29-08:00","id":1061145,"title":"","content":"It was first scenario with character here. Basically, Created go in to scene that pointed him life lesson that will change his goals - he hit's Superlative Milestone. And <i>then</i> he decides he need to change Refinements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}